WEBVTT


00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:00.950
Hey, man, stop!


00:02:10.407 --> 00:02:13.379
Mister, we want your money.


00:02:14.382 --> 00:02:15.007
Hurry


00:02:17.623 --> 00:02:18.385
Hurry up!


00:02:21.397 --> 00:02:22.159
Do it now!


00:02:27.008 --> 00:02:27.565
No!


00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:13.416
A TOUCH OF SIN


00:05:27.706 --> 00:05:34.208
Black Gold Mountain


00:05:56.262 --> 00:05:58.096
What is the path to the Black Gold Mountain?


00:05:58.167 --> 00:05:58.963
You're on it.


00:05:59.034 --> 00:06:01.506
- Rodovia 307? - Keep going that way.


00:07:31.021 --> 00:07:31.544
Dahai.


00:07:54.334 --> 00:07:55.702
Whose bike is that out there?


00:07:56.339 --> 00:07:58.707
- I do not know. - Do not know!


00:08:01.583 --> 00:08:02.608
Sit down, Dahai.


00:08:03.687 --> 00:08:06.249
It's been standing there for two days. No idea whose it is.


00:08:07.094 --> 00:08:09.690
If nobody claims her, I'll sell it.


00:08:12.204 --> 00:08:15.108
So if the Audi A6 the village chief was parked ...


00:08:15.478 --> 00:08:17.447
outside his house, would you sell that, too?


00:08:18.718 --> 00:08:19.651
What do you think?


00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:23.115
That A6 belongs to everyone here in the village.


00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:25.226
He sold the state the coal mine ...


00:08:25.329 --> 00:08:26.560
for the money to buy that fancy car.


00:08:26.667 --> 00:08:29.195
So that's why I found the car so familiar.


00:08:29.539 --> 00:08:32.510
Those shiny new wheels are actually mine.


00:08:32.578 --> 00:08:33.672
You caught the spirit.


00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:38.512
Dahai. It's a shame you were not born ...


00:08:38.758 --> 00:08:40.489
for example, before the war.


00:08:40.762 --> 00:08:43.460
Surely you would have made the rank of General.


00:08:43.533 --> 00:08:47.839
We'll see what happens when I make the complaint to Beijing.


00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:51.873
The boss and the new boss, Jiao will be sent to jail.


00:08:52.152 --> 00:08:54.349
Before even reaching Tainan ...


00:08:54.589 --> 00:08:56.219
the boss's men will bribe you.


00:08:56.294 --> 00:08:59.390
Why do you think I studied law?


00:08:59.633 --> 00:09:02.834
Boss sold a collective property,  which he could not do.


00:09:02.907 --> 00:09:05.468
The bastard accepted bribes.


00:09:05.545 --> 00:09:07.014
Surely he'll get 20 years.


00:09:07.082 --> 00:09:10.817
As for the boss, Jiao Shengli, he's also involved in that, is he not?


00:09:10.923 --> 00:09:12.984
He will be charged with theft ...


00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:14.290
and covering up accidents in the mine.


00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:15.998
All this serves to close the mine.


00:09:16.266 --> 00:09:18.065
Believe you me. Believe it.


00:09:19.606 --> 00:09:22.043
If the coal mine had been  yours ...


00:09:22.613 --> 00:09:25.813
you also would have acted just like him. Just like him.


00:09:25.886 --> 00:09:26.876
Sure.


00:09:27.622 --> 00:09:30.595
Jiao's Maserati is parked in the courtyard.


00:09:30.863 --> 00:09:31.592
He never drives it.


00:09:31.931 --> 00:09:35.632
If you sell it, you can buy a drink for everyone.


00:09:35.706 --> 00:09:37.573
I don't want his damnar.


00:09:41.451 --> 00:09:42.145
Sanming.


00:09:42.218 --> 00:09:44.416
- Bought a train ticket? - Yes, I bought one.


00:09:44.691 --> 00:09:47.822
- For what? - See my wife on the New Year.


00:09:47.898 --> 00:09:49.161
How romantic!


00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.064
The police are here.


00:09:53.141 --> 00:09:56.011
Police. Come on, stop eating. Stop eating.


00:09:57.783 --> 00:09:58.272
Inspectors.


00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:02.050
All here are migrant workers?


00:10:02.158 --> 00:10:02.819
Yes.


00:10:02.894 --> 00:10:05.660
- What's the problem? - A crime in Shibawan.


00:10:05.732 --> 00:10:07.204
The migrants need to be interrogated.


00:10:07.204 --> 00:10:08.831
Everyone out there.


00:10:08.906 --> 00:10:10.068
Alright.


00:10:10.143 --> 00:10:11.008
Quickly.


00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:20.922
Chief. Village chief ...


00:10:21.632 --> 00:10:23.966
when you sold the coal mine you promised ...


00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:25.734
profit sharing. So where's our part?


00:10:26.008 --> 00:10:27.236
I said that in a private conversation.
I don't have time for this right now.


00:10:29.516 --> 00:10:32.248
Right. So explain this to the disciplinary committee.


00:10:37.564 --> 00:10:40.969
You picked the wrong time to get into a fight.


00:10:42.474 --> 00:10:44.445
Could end up getting killed.


00:10:58.071 --> 00:10:58.971
You do not want to discuss it?


00:10:59.876 --> 00:11:00.706
You talk too much.


00:11:10.598 --> 00:11:12.897
Very well. These are from Chongqing.


00:11:32.475 --> 00:11:34.034
Stay there. Next.


00:11:56.623 --> 00:11:57.784
He's running.


00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:20.430
Fucking animal!


00:13:07.934 --> 00:13:09.198
What's happening, Dahai?


00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:11.672
I am writing to the disciplinary committee ...


00:13:11.942 --> 00:13:14.641
to file a complaint against the boss and Jiao Shengli.


00:13:16.083 --> 00:13:18.554
Girl. A registered letter.


00:13:18.622 --> 00:13:19.555
Where to?


00:13:19.892 --> 00:13:22.487
Beijing. Zhongnanhal. The committee.


00:13:22.562 --> 00:13:24.465
I need the full address.


00:13:25.603 --> 00:13:26.832
Zhongnanhai, Beijing.


00:13:27.105 --> 00:13:29.576
That's not enough. I need the whole address.


00:13:31.182 --> 00:13:34.153
What? Everyone knows Zhongnanhai.


00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:34.813
But it's not enough.


00:13:36.259 --> 00:13:38.786
Girl, are you on the boss's side?


00:13:38.863 --> 00:13:40.331
Is he paying you off?


00:13:41.501 --> 00:13:45.373
Or are you fucking Jiao? Did he buy you a car?


00:13:45.442 --> 00:13:47.242
Are you crazy? Go away!


00:13:48.582 --> 00:13:50.212
You two must be together in this.


00:13:50.287 --> 00:13:51.312
Out.


00:13:51.389 --> 00:13:53.952
There is no justice! There is no justice!


00:13:54.829 --> 00:13:55.659
There is no justice!


00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:07.052
Hurry!


00:14:07.119 --> 00:14:09.785
All aboard! We are starting!


00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:10.822
Let's go!


00:14:11.061 --> 00:14:11.926
Dahai!


00:14:12.231 --> 00:14:14.063
Dahai! Come on!


00:14:14.335 --> 00:14:15.564
Dahai! Come on! Come on!


00:14:15.637 --> 00:14:16.696
What  is this about?


00:14:16.773 --> 00:14:19.436
It's a gift from boss Jiao. A bag of flour per person.


00:14:19.713 --> 00:14:20.476
Come up here, come on.


00:14:26.292 --> 00:14:28.229
Jiao has a new private jet.


00:14:28.497 --> 00:14:30.432
He's flying in from Hong Kong.


00:14:30.869 --> 00:14:32.030
We are the welcoming party.


00:14:32.372 --> 00:14:33.806
Everyone will receive a bag of flour.


00:14:33.974 --> 00:14:34.839
A plane?


00:14:34.909 --> 00:14:37.277
To live on this earth is not enough for him?


00:14:40.053 --> 00:14:44.859
Dahai, say, were you at the coal mine when they started shooting?


00:14:44.929 --> 00:14:45.452
I was.


00:14:47.068 --> 00:14:48.764
Who was the guy who ran?


00:14:49.373 --> 00:14:51.899
A hauler from the coal field. From Sichuan.


00:14:52.812 --> 00:14:53.939
Why did he run?


00:14:54.215 --> 00:14:56.684
Weren't the murders in Shibawan?


00:14:56.752 --> 00:14:58.655
He is an escaped prisoner.


00:14:58.724 --> 00:15:00.592
Killed someone in his hometown.


00:15:00.662 --> 00:15:02.130
He's wanted there.


00:15:02.198 --> 00:15:03.894
He thought he would be arrested.


00:15:03.967 --> 00:15:05.528
The guy panicked and fled.


00:15:05.605 --> 00:15:07.904
And did they get him?


00:15:07.977 --> 00:15:09.104
Of course they did.


00:15:13.353 --> 00:15:15.881
- What happened in Shibawan? - Have not you heard?


00:15:15.959 --> 00:15:18.452
Someone killed three guys yesterday.


00:15:18.731 --> 00:15:20.497
Three died in Shibawan.


00:15:20.736 --> 00:15:23.207
- Says who? - I do not know.


00:15:23.274 --> 00:15:26.611
Earlier today, armed police were


00:15:26.915 --> 00:15:28.042
em Shibawan.


00:15:28.118 --> 00:15:30.680
Right. How tragic, right?


00:15:34.663 --> 00:15:38.433
Accountant Liu. Your accounts are up to date?


00:15:40.074 --> 00:15:43.343
Listen. When the boss Jiao bought the coal mine ...


00:15:43.414 --> 00:15:47.616
he said 40% of the profits would go to the village.


00:15:47.689 --> 00:15:51.219
How much of the last 14 years of earnings he owes?


00:15:52.398 --> 00:15:55.461
Listen. In 2001 ...


00:15:55.572 --> 00:15:59.136
village council signed the sale of the coal mine.


00:15:59.213 --> 00:16:00.876
Who asked you to sell?


00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:03.216
Was the contract discussed?


00:16:03.288 --> 00:16:04.918
We had to keep our word.


00:16:05.927 --> 00:16:10.196
But Jiao is so rich that he even bought a plane.


00:16:10.836 --> 00:16:12.306
That's not fair.


00:16:12.841 --> 00:16:14.742
He works hard.


00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:17.908
How much did you get in bribes?.


00:16:18.987 --> 00:16:21.651
- How much? Tell me, how much? - Hey, come on, please.


00:16:22.728 --> 00:16:25.790
How much did you take in bribes?


00:16:26.033 --> 00:16:26.659
Open the door.


00:16:27.837 --> 00:16:29.237
People like you, are more miserable ...


00:16:29.306 --> 00:16:31.402
and diabolical than the village boss and Jiao.


00:16:38.727 --> 00:16:40.958
Just listen ... They ...


00:16:41.199 --> 00:16:42.064
Do not talk to me.


00:16:51.551 --> 00:16:53.784
Repeat all.


00:16:54.624 --> 00:17:00.194
Welcome. Welcome! Warm greetings!


00:17:00.805 --> 00:17:01.328
Great.


00:17:03.242 --> 00:17:04.039
The plane's coming.


00:17:55.447 --> 00:18:00.948
Welcome. Welcome! Warm greetings!


00:18:02.561 --> 00:18:05.397
Mr. Jiao, you have reached a new level.


00:18:05.801 --> 00:18:06.666
Let's move forward together.


00:18:08.107 --> 00:18:11.877
Congratulations, lady. Children,  the flowers.


00:18:13.316 --> 00:18:18.817
Welcome. Welcome! Warm greetings!


00:18:21.801 --> 00:18:25.136
Mr. Jiao, look here.


00:18:26.544 --> 00:18:28.604
Closer. This.


00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:32.621
- Say something, sir. - Later.


00:18:32.889 --> 00:18:33.755
Let's go.


00:18:44.981 --> 00:18:46.244
How are you, Aunt?


00:18:50.993 --> 00:18:53.521
Thanks for coming. Wow, it's been awhile!.


00:18:54.901 --> 00:18:56.096
Shengli!


00:18:56.738 --> 00:18:57.500
Dahai.


00:18:57.839 --> 00:19:01.040
- Shengli. Congratulations! - Thanks, Dahai.


00:19:01.881 --> 00:19:03.441
You're a hard man to reach.


00:19:03.685 --> 00:19:05.814
I have a topic you'd like to discuss with you.


00:19:06.089 --> 00:19:07.491
I need a favor.


00:19:07.794 --> 00:19:09.422
Whatever you need, just ask.


00:19:09.697 --> 00:19:11.634
Sponsor my trip to Beijing.


00:19:11.936 --> 00:19:15.272
To bring charges against you and the village chief.


00:19:15.609 --> 00:19:18.547
I know. Come talk to me later.


00:19:18.916 --> 00:19:21.078
No, here in front of everybody.


00:19:21.153 --> 00:19:23.716
Can you not discuss the economy of the village?


00:19:27.968 --> 00:19:29.130
What are you are looking at?!


00:20:09.852 --> 00:20:12.583
Xiao Bai, you play golf?


00:20:44.523 --> 00:20:47.323
I'm here to apologize on behalf of Shengli group.


00:21:08.603 --> 00:21:09.399
Case closed.


00:22:51.445 --> 00:22:52.241
Where's your mother?


00:22:53.315 --> 00:22:54.011
Who are you?


00:22:54.919 --> 00:22:56.079
Do not you remember me?


00:22:56.989 --> 00:22:58.549
I'm your uncle, from Black Gold Mountain.


00:22:59.927 --> 00:23:03.128
Mama went out to look for food. She'll be back soon.


00:23:09.481 --> 00:23:11.245
"Animal".


00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:16.122
And where is your father?


00:23:17.431 --> 00:23:19.229
Out hunting ... "animals".


00:23:20.637 --> 00:23:23.472
- On which mountain? - Jiaokou.


00:23:26.882 --> 00:23:27.748
Dahai.


00:23:29.188 --> 00:23:29.882
But what ...


00:23:32.228 --> 00:23:33.286
What are you doing here?


00:23:34.431 --> 00:23:35.832
I'm going to stay in the city for a couple days.


00:23:37.403 --> 00:23:38.600
Feel free, then.


00:23:40.276 --> 00:23:42.770
Ganggang, eat first, then do the school work.


00:23:42.849 --> 00:23:43.908
Okay, mother.


00:23:45.887 --> 00:23:46.982
But what ...


00:23:49.661 --> 00:23:50.425
They told me...


00:23:55.373 --> 00:23:58.505
Years ago I introduced you to a woman Wangchun.


00:23:58.847 --> 00:24:00.611
You were a beautiful couple.


00:24:01.153 --> 00:24:04.684
But you ... Why did you not want to go out with her?


00:24:05.862 --> 00:24:09.028
You never thought of yourself.


00:24:12.575 --> 00:24:14.100
And now you are making accusations.


00:24:14.979 --> 00:24:18.008
Even if you keep right on talking, you will get old.


00:24:18.821 --> 00:24:21.554
I am old. I do not care.


00:24:22.795 --> 00:24:26.462
Do not be silly. You are in middle age.


00:24:32.215 --> 00:24:33.615
The kids are home.


00:24:37.123 --> 00:24:38.286
I miss you.


00:24:39.263 --> 00:24:40.457
You're still immature.


00:24:41.566 --> 00:24:43.799
I told you when we were in school.


00:24:44.405 --> 00:24:46.273
There's more to life than getting rich.


00:24:47.379 --> 00:24:49.474
You want to be worse than Jiao Shengli?


00:24:49.884 --> 00:24:52.650
What? How can you compare me to him?


00:24:53.089 --> 00:24:55.287
If not him, then who?


00:24:55.594 --> 00:24:57.030
You and he were classmates.


00:24:57.766 --> 00:24:59.462
Look at what he has become.


00:24:59.737 --> 00:25:01.036
Compared with us here.


00:25:02.976 --> 00:25:06.916
You have your house in Wujinshan.


00:25:07.586 --> 00:25:12.585
But my husband and I have a house that is ours.


00:25:15.434 --> 00:25:16.870
Enough complaining.


00:25:17.205 --> 00:25:21.441
If you have time and money, open a restaurant or a store.


00:25:21.714 --> 00:25:23.241
To make money and get married. Your life belongs to you.


00:25:23.519 --> 00:25:26.923
Stop worrying about what others do.


00:25:31.702 --> 00:25:33.694
My dear, wait and see.


00:25:34.741 --> 00:25:39.115
You bet I'll be worse than the village head or Jiao.


00:26:09.944 --> 00:26:11.003
Sr. Golf?


00:26:14.354 --> 00:26:16.348
- What did you call me? - Mr. Golf.


00:26:16.559 --> 00:26:19.656
That's what they're calling you. Did you not know?


00:26:39.672 --> 00:26:40.469
Mr. Golf.


00:26:56.104 --> 00:26:57.199
Eu...


00:27:00.113 --> 00:27:01.513
Lin Chong...


00:27:04.923 --> 00:27:08.191
I grabbed my sword in anger ...


00:27:08.430 --> 00:27:11.266
and beheaded two henchmen Gao Giu.


00:27:11.537 --> 00:27:13.973
Fortunately for me, the official Chai ...


00:27:14.208 --> 00:27:16.702
gave me a document that prevents me ...


00:27:16.947 --> 00:27:20.852
from going to Mount Liang.


00:29:01.023 --> 00:29:01.682
Dahai.


00:29:30.016 --> 00:29:30.539
Good day.


00:29:32.419 --> 00:29:33.479
Dahai, good day


00:29:33.556 --> 00:29:35.617
I want to talk to your husband.


00:29:35.693 --> 00:29:36.662
Feel free.


00:29:48.419 --> 00:29:49.580
Write.


00:29:53.562 --> 00:29:54.655
Write what?


00:29:57.804 --> 00:30:00.368
You know how much the village chief pocketed.


00:30:01.278 --> 00:30:02.578
Make a confession.


00:30:02.649 --> 00:30:03.878
You're being ridiculous.


00:30:13.235 --> 00:30:15.229
What are you doing? This is dangerous.


00:30:17.043 --> 00:30:18.171
Write.


00:30:21.754 --> 00:30:22.915
Write it!


00:30:34.045 --> 00:30:35.308
Write.


00:31:00.431 --> 00:31:00.920
Shoot!


00:31:04.105 --> 00:31:04.902
Come on, shoot!


00:31:19.202 --> 00:31:21.468
You are too cowardly to kill me!


00:31:28.955 --> 00:31:29.547
Dahai!


00:32:50.988 --> 00:32:53.652
Hello? Village boss.


00:32:54.027 --> 00:32:57.192
It Liuliu. I just got here.


00:32:59.638 --> 00:33:00.366
What do you want me to do?


00:33:04.013 --> 00:33:06.247
Do not worry. I'll do it this afternoon.


00:33:08.456 --> 00:33:08.981
Mr. Golf.


00:33:10.060 --> 00:33:11.926
- Where's the boss? - He's in the temple.


00:33:15.503 --> 00:33:17.633
What did you call me?


00:33:19.043 --> 00:33:22.210
Mr. Golf. Isn't that your foreign name?


00:33:23.185 --> 00:33:24.176
Asshole.


00:33:24.990 --> 00:33:25.684
What did you say?


00:33:54.616 --> 00:33:56.083
- Dahai! - What is it?


00:33:56.151 --> 00:33:58.385
- Where are you going?


00:33:58.591 --> 00:33:59.114
Are you going hunting?


00:33:59.192 --> 00:34:00.820
Yes. Hunting animals.


00:34:21.037 --> 00:34:24.100
Dahai. Do not do anything stupid.


00:34:34.362 --> 00:34:35.194
Calm down.


00:34:37.502 --> 00:34:39.803
Let's sit down and talk.


00:34:41.177 --> 00:34:42.009
And solve this issue.


00:35:01.151 --> 00:35:03.951
Listen, Dahai, do not be impulsive.


00:35:15.011 --> 00:35:15.570
Let sit ...


00:36:01.472 --> 00:36:02.029
Idiot.


00:37:29.582 --> 00:37:30.448
Dahai?


00:37:44.981 --> 00:37:47.816
How can we take care of it? Let's just talk.


00:39:49.298 --> 00:39:53.534
Hey mister. Mister, you got a light?


00:39:54.875 --> 00:39:55.366
No.


00:40:11.944 --> 00:40:15.509
Motorcycle taxi! Motorcycle taxi!


00:40:24.971 --> 00:40:27.668
- Hey man, where are you going? - Take the expressway.


00:40:27.742 --> 00:40:29.546
Towards Chongging or Wushan?


00:40:29.546 --> 00:40:30.241
Wushan.


00:40:30.314 --> 00:40:31.212
Let's go.


00:40:57.536 --> 00:41:01.805
Our dear Ms. Zhou worked hard to raise their children.


00:41:02.546 --> 00:41:04.412
And now,as she turns 70, we wish her ...


00:41:04.683 --> 00:41:08.589
happiness, good health and long life.


00:41:11.164 --> 00:41:14.626
And now, let's welcome the second son and his family.


00:41:14.872 --> 00:41:16.670
And his good wishes.


00:41:17.109 --> 00:41:18.577
All her children are here!


00:41:21.017 --> 00:41:23.077
The younger son has returned!


00:41:32.774 --> 00:41:33.742
You're back ...


00:41:34.577 --> 00:41:35.272
Brother ...


00:41:54.016 --> 00:41:55.041
Why are you running away?


00:41:55.285 --> 00:41:56.913
Come here. Come here.


00:42:04.236 --> 00:42:04.760
Mother


00:42:20.938 --> 00:42:21.769
Do not cry.


00:43:08.935 --> 00:43:10.062
How did you come?


00:43:15.146 --> 00:43:16.205
I came by boat.


00:43:18.720 --> 00:43:19.813
And before that?


00:43:25.668 --> 00:43:28.400
I received the money you sent. 130,000 yuan.


00:43:32.215 --> 00:43:33.011
